; Example: nxt persisted workplaces (copy to 0:/sys/nxt-user-wcs.g to use)
; Loaded automatically by nxt.g after the board pack when the file exists.
; Runtime: M6520 / nxt-wcs-apply / nxt-wcs-set / nxt-wcs-clear run
; M98 P"nxt-user-wcs-sync.g" to refresh this file
; (disable: set global.nxtAutoPersistWcs = false in nxt-user-vars.g).
; G10-only changes (without those helpers) are not auto-captured until the next apply/set
; or a manual M98 P"nxt-user-wcs-sync.g".
;
; G10 L2 P1 X100.0 Y50.0 Z-5.0
; G10 L2 P2 X200.0 Y75.0 Z-5.0
; M98 P"nxt-select-wcs.g" W1
